"note": "CANDIDATE — unplaced. Kentucky birth index: Christopher Thomas Pullen, born 8 Aug 1989 in Kenton County, mother Teresa M. Shinkle (vol. 068, cert. 33566). His mother's marriages are now traced: Teresa Marlene Shinkle (b. 9 Jul 1964, Kenton Co.) married Kenneth Sebastian in 1982; she then married Mark T. Pullen — \"Teresa M Sebastian\" × \"Mark T Pullen\", 17 Apr 1990, Boone County (Kentucky marriage index) — eight months after Christopher's birth; and their 2005 divorce still records her as \"Teresa M Shinkle\" (Kentucky divorce index). Mark T. Pullen (b. 21 Mar 1960, Jefferson Co.; mother Judith Baker) belongs to a Northern Kentucky Pullen family with no documented tie to this tree, and no record names Christopher's father — so he stays unplaced, with that couple recorded as the likely but unproven parents. POTENTIALS 2026-10-15 (round 40): the 2005 divorce-index entry names no children (Mark T Pullen b. 1961, age 44; Teresa M Shinkle b. 1966, age 39), so it does not tie Christopher to Mark T. Pullen. The Kentucky marriage index adds Mark T Pullen's first marriage — Ramona J Wolfe, 28 Nov 1980, Boone County (he was 20, she 18) — and his 17 Apr 1990 licence records his marital status as “last marriage ended by divorce”. Christopher's birth-index entry (vol. 068, cert. 33566; register date 12 Sep 1989) again names only his mother, and a search under mother Teresa M. Shinkle then surfaced no sibling — corrected 2026-10-15: the same index does carry one (Megan Sebastian, born 2 Oct 1986 to the same mother; see the round-45 note). POTENTIALS 2026-10-15 (round 45): a sibling is now on record. The same Kentucky index carries “Megan Sebastian,” born 2 Oct 1986 in Kenton County, mother Teresa M. Shinkle (vol. 076, cert. 37730; register date 21 Oct 1986) — three years before Christopher and by the same mother, so the two are half-siblings through her; the Sebastian surname matches Teresa M. Shinkle's 1982 marriage to Kenneth Sebastian. No father is named on either entry, and no third child of Teresa M. Shinkle appears in the index (1961-1999). Both children now sit under her card, Teresa M. Shinkle.\n\nROUND 48 (2026-10-15): the obituary lanes were read for Mark Pullen (the recorded-but-unproven father line) — Newspapers.com obituary index (2,068 fuzzy rows) and the U.S. Obituary Collection (434): no Northern Kentucky or Cincinnati Mark Pullen with a family named in the rows read. One bare entry carries a 'Mark Pullen — Cincinnati, Ohio' line in the U.S. Obituary Collection with the associated name 'Albert' and no dates; it is recorded as a lead only, not a match. The father question stays open.",
